{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach it, grab it, and check its properties. Scan area otherwise. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
